[{"title":"又为刘玉真黄文燕黄玉英三歌姬即席赋 其二","author":"张萱","text":"飞花片片各东西，狼藉同沾浊水泥。\n尚喜枝头春意闹，黄莺啼罢鹁鸠啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又为刘玉真黄文燕黄玉英三歌姬即席赋 其三","author":"张萱","text":"千金一笑忆当年，掷果盈车数坠鞭。\n今日文园已消渴，当垆休问杖头钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋写山水寄林澹生道尊 其一","author":"张萱","text":"萧萧秋色满孱颜，万斛烟光点染间。\n遥想真人在天际，应留玄赏问溪山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋写山水寄林澹生道尊 其二","author":"张萱","text":"清音小阁倚江皋，白首凭栏望独劳。\n欲识烟霞真面目，残山剩水试挥毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芳春节晓晴登百尺楼仿王叔明山水 其一","author":"张萱","text":"撩人春色百花妍，盘礴登楼拂素笺。\n试向楼前寻粉本，骊峰榕水艳阳天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芳春节晓晴登百尺楼仿王叔明山水 其二","author":"张萱","text":"戏驱老腕斗春妍，树色山光忽满笺。\n兴剧笔狂风日好，乍晴乍雨养花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛未岁除冯无文客止园贻诗馈食余分杖头钱馈之用来韵对使赋答 其一","author":"张萱","text":"雾里看花老病身，年来鱼鸟转相亲。\n欲蹑柴桑出门乞，授餐喜有食鱼人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛未岁除冯无文客止园贻诗馈食余分杖头钱馈之用来韵对使赋答 其二","author":"张萱","text":"悬毛两目一閒身，性癖耽佳笔研亲。\n室罄卖文聊馈岁，探囊分饷苦吟人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还拙老人五日还泰和赠以葛袍题其袂而别之","author":"张萱","text":"廿年缟带暂分携，五日河桥赠绤絺。\n清风两腋歌无斁，缠臂何须五色丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18996,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写西园秋色图寄张绍和 其一","author":"张萱","text":"好音曾忆十年馀，琬琰新编独起予。\n百尺楼头写秋色，水瓜聊以报琼琚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18997,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写西园秋色图寄张绍和 其二","author":"张萱","text":"疏慵衰病老园公，芳讯频来石户翁。\n净几明窗试游戏，一帧数笔寄冥鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18998,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写西园秋色图寄张绍和 其三","author":"张萱","text":"轻岚薄黛满疏林，却喜茅绹瞰碧浔。\n为语屋梁明月夜，梦来须向此中寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18999,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写西园秋色图寄张绍和 其四","author":"张萱","text":"萧萧晴色正堪怜，白首凭栏思杳然。\n欲问西园真面目，山容水态在蛮笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其一","author":"张萱","text":"閒阶荒砌满苔衣，昼永林空独掩扉。\n为语小厖休吠客，恐惊狎鸟各分飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二","author":"张萱","text":"万朵芙蓉一抹烟，蒸云酿雨逗前川。\n窗外老梅香绽玉，溪边枯柳絮装绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三","author":"张萱","text":"春色无端到薜萝，主人慵病奈春何。\n门前无数娟娟竹，喜有王猷日日过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四","author":"张萱","text":"村酿初香何处酤，青帘遥指隔重湖。\n自喜寻常无酒债，却怜衰懒有诗逋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五","author":"张萱","text":"长林春到未多时，闭户留春莫惜迟。\n笑答孙孩问春信，且同小妇数花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其六","author":"张萱","text":"两肩白发老园公，饮犊林边伴牧童。\n笑语去时花影外，笛声归处月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其七","author":"张萱","text":"今宵花信问明朝，几处枝头冻未销。\n却怪五更花底雨，吹风叶被一庭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其八","author":"张萱","text":"莫问山禽与水禽，绕枝争噪镜中林。\n楼上主人舒一啸，天风吹落凤鸾音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其九","author":"张萱","text":"梧竹周遭短径斜，平分春色不须加。\n喜我花前春似酒，笑他海上枣如瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十","author":"张萱","text":"不向中逵问好仇，半生善草野蛩谋。\n亦知避世今无地，共说祈年已有秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十一","author":"张萱","text":"燕瘖莺噤蝶倦时，一分春色十分奇。\n眼前奇处人常共，说与人人总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十二","author":"张萱","text":"干旄孑孑数停车，绛鞲传呼为借书。\n共缚牛腰寻老蠹，不知五色近何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十三","author":"张萱","text":"长把纶竿卯水东，钓璜台下笑非熊。\n鼠穴纷争蜗角斗，嘴边烽火耳边风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十四","author":"张萱","text":"鳜鱼腹子蟹输芒，蓼岸芦汀昼正长。\n五石瓠中新酿熟，客来莫厌渴姚羌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十五","author":"张萱","text":"沧洲镇上草茸茸，白水青塘春正同。\n柱杖褰裳无远近，牧鸡人是白头翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十六","author":"张萱","text":"半生已痼烟霞癖，一室长悬笠屐图。\n浊酒独斟常酩酊，残编长对自伊吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十七","author":"张萱","text":"屋梁明月不须悬，醉向花前枕石眠。\n欲付禅那还古德，且将项领让时贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十八","author":"张萱","text":"渴饮休寻洗耳泉，野歌何处唱原田。\n喜闻社日今朝是，笑趁鸡豚赛有年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其十九","author":"张萱","text":"觅句常骑贾岛驴，归来击壤向康衢。\n帝力如今春共满，巍巍荡荡可名无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十","author":"张萱","text":"楼头欹枕对斜曛，疏懒三分病一分。\n睡起数杯浇磊磈，笑拈綵笔欲凌云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十一","author":"张萱","text":"曾对青藜太乙精，路通金碧撷英灵。\n小妇年来知笔札，挑灯口授伏生经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十二","author":"张萱","text":"谁能咄咄坐书空，丛桂淹留十亩中。\n家徒壁立君休笑，万轴牙签可是穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十三","author":"张萱","text":"楼卧元龙架蔚蓝，沆瀣为桨日日酣。\n笑问粗豪湖海气，如何镜里白䰐鬖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十四","author":"张萱","text":"竹外歌諠落日樵，山归可是采芝谣。\n溪头争渡渔郎醉，翻却鱼筒更折桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十五","author":"张萱","text":"云开风定雨常移，雨我新畬及旧菑。\n老圃年来曾学稼，请听布谷莫愆期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十六","author":"张萱","text":"榕溪新涨碧微茫，网集前滩鹙在梁。\n一曲可航还可揭，半篙堪濯亦堪湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十七","author":"张萱","text":"披蓑不用鹿为裘，放鹤亭边放鹿游。\n好语群麀且攸伏，食苹切勿近高秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十八","author":"张萱","text":"九还不用化黄金，何必蒲团戏五禽。\n养生主在机心少，自信西园是灌阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其二十九","author":"张萱","text":"较雨商晴不可凭，晴来雨过晚霞蒸。\n殢雨尊前花欲语，送晴帘外月生棱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十","author":"张萱","text":"林边一水水边山，象岭骊峰几席间。\n无数烟鬟新沐雨，似勾诗债向柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十一","author":"张萱","text":"老来生活在诗篇，却被诗魔日绕缠。\n自哂耽佳由性癖，曲生何事又争权。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十二","author":"张萱","text":"骊龙颔下数珠呈，影满南窗妒月明。\n惊起园公呼小妇，笑听童孺读书声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十三","author":"张萱","text":"花事平章亦太劳，躄奴秃婢作萧曹。\n洗竹浇花皆惰废，沿溪戏水说□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十四","author":"张萱","text":"白眼慵开恐见人，登场傀儡一时新。\n揶揄鬼子拦街笑，为笑园公病又贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十五","author":"张萱","text":"闭户常翻王局文，科头袒背对晴曛。\n人嘲人解从人意，不学当年扬子云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十六","author":"张萱","text":"匏叶谁歌数问津，朝来埼岸水痕新。\n萧萧馆畔蜻蜒舞，不避双林把钓人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十七","author":"张萱","text":"地半黄垆半白沙，偏宜老圃瘦桑麻。\n夭桃秾李能妆点，亦向游人共放花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十八","author":"张萱","text":"疏水为园已廿年，每防波撼芮虞田。\n双池蓄水鱼千石，不学陶朱师计然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其三十九","author":"张萱","text":"插篱编槿莫稀疏，欲试园公种树书。\n抱瓮索绹聊度日，数椽高枕果吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十","author":"张萱","text":"生心无住是南能，落叶归根挂葛藤。\n彗业有庵常骂祖，前身休拟德云僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十一","author":"张萱","text":"月明曾约老渔翁，为伴玄真白浪中。\n龟枕网帘凉梦熟，洞庭春色岂无功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十二","author":"张萱","text":"幽栖用拙道常存，不向桃花再问源。\n春色满园关得住，何须白昼掩柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十三","author":"张萱","text":"数将生计问春光，问得春光话更长。\n止恐北邻□鹅鸭，且随村社问牛羊。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十四","author":"张萱","text":"花容烂熳鸟声繁，剥喙何妨日到门。\n莫说门前云出岫，商山原不在西园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十五","author":"张萱","text":"烟霞已痼断尘缘，白首浮家范蠡船。\n浊酒一壶书一卷，桃花深处艳阳天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十六","author":"张萱","text":"白鹤洲前白鹤飞，在阴常和弄斜晖。\n冰壶门外双双舞，何日云巢乳雪衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十七","author":"张萱","text":"黄鸟缗蛮雨露柯，白羊点缀小儿坡。\n莫教窗蠹常潜蝎，且任墙涎共缀蜗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十八","author":"张萱","text":"失不忧疑得不欣，端居一阁有清音。\n凭栏拄颊常遐瞩，剩水残山更会心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其四十九","author":"张萱","text":"一沟来自白云泉，灌得荒畦已几年。\n隔水园蔬半堪剪，更驱健犊垦城堧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十","author":"张萱","text":"遮莫花神溷乃公，登楼夜夜问阴宗。\n密语林花须著意，楼头昨夜月如弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十一","author":"张萱","text":"五□□□□□郎，果腹何须适莽苍。\n请向醉乡留日月，少陵休宿赞公房。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十二","author":"张萱","text":"不学于陵亦灌园，诛茅藩棘缚松门。\n桔槔挂壁无他事，且共邻翁出负暄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十三","author":"张萱","text":"谁系慈航双树堤，天公到此不投霓。\n为园已种菩提果，极乐由来亦在西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十四","author":"张萱","text":"莫道家贫只旧醅，尊开更上一层台。\n最喜捲帘閒野眺，罗浮爽气自西来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十五","author":"张萱","text":"绿蘋红蓼媚江天，谁扣空江月下舷。\n可是老渔歌濯足，园公诗思忽如泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十六","author":"张萱","text":"月令惊看吕氏书，忙将踪迹混樵渔。\n尚带馀寒试春服，寻春须在九春初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十七","author":"张萱","text":"儿童拍掌报花开，小妇残妆带笑来。\n最爱山桃能照水，縠文风过锦潆洄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十八","author":"张萱","text":"高台木末揽晴霞，影带归鸦日欲斜。\n万斛春情向何处，扶筇先到耦耕家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其五十九","author":"张萱","text":"松亭竹阁稍霐寥，厥草惟夭厥木乔。\n卒岁东皇长作主，园公不问玉衡杓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居六十章 其六十","author":"张萱","text":"已搆层楼上翠氛，钧天广乐几回闻。\n四望江山如有待，一时鸟兽可同群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日园居口号六十章 其一","author":"张萱","text":"径荒客少门常楗，濯魄台前新月偃。\n桂丛深处足淹留，顿觉地偏心自远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日园居口号六十章 其二","author":"张萱","text":"行散榕堤逢鹬蚌，须问十三禅八棒。\n从今解脱莫相持，汝自修翎他短项。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日园居口号六十章 其三","author":"张萱","text":"冠山海鳖戴笠蚁，来扣柴扉何率尔。\n倒屣空林喜足音，如何面目都非是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日园居口号六十章 其四","author":"张萱","text":"园林小有饶嘉卉，更喜徛徛歌有斐。\n秋深地癖堪避人，出门恐遇黎丘鬼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]